*June 14th - '''mouz NXT''' acquire [[siuhy]] and [[szejn]] from [[Izako Boars]]. <ref name="Izako">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/IzakoBoars/status/1404362986928676870|date=2021-06-14|title=Jak już zauważyliście, ostatnimi czasy na serwerze brakuje @siuhycs oraz @szejn1k|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|trans_title=As you have noticed, @siuhycs and @szejn1k have been missing from the server recently|author=[[Izako Boars]]}}</ref><ref name="NXT"/>
*June 18th - '''mouz NXT''' are officially announced and the roster is finalized with the signings of [[JDC]] and [[xertioN]]. Additionally, [[sycrone]] is brought on as coach. <ref name="NXT">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/mousesports/status/1405890943413325830|date=2021-06-18|title=This is mouz NXT|author=[[mousesports]]}}</ref>

