* June 3rd - '''NOVAQ''' bench [[tasman]] due to health reasons and sign [[buster]] as his replacement. <ref name="-tasman,+buster">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-227506535_44|title=В составе нашей команды произошли временные изменения|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=There have been some temporary changes in our team|date=2025-06-03|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
* September 4th - '''NOVAQ''' part ways with [[buster]]. <ref name="-buster">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/DOLfV6mDGVL/|title=Сегодня мы прощаемся с Тимуром «buster» Тулеповым|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to Timur "buster" Tulepov|date=2025-09-04|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
