* September 6th - '''NOVAQ''' sign [[modeSavage]]. <ref name="+modeSavage">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/DOO5NjYjf23/|title=Обновление в составе Team NOVAQ |language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Update in Team NOVAQ|date=2025-09-06|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
* September 19th - '''NOVAQ''' sign [[anv1k]] as their new coach. <ref name="+anv1k">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/DOytg2BDZbZ/|title=Обновления в штабе Team NOVAQ|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Updates in Team NOVAQ staff|date=2025-09-19|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
* December 28th - '''NOVAQ''' part ways with [[anv1k]] and [[modeSavage]] and sign [[k4zmo]]. <ref name="-anv1k">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/teamnovaq/1449|title=Anv1k покидает пост тренера|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Anv1k resigns as coach|date=2025-12-28|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref><ref name="-modesavage">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/teamnovaq/1450|title=Сегодня мы прощаемся с Адилем «modeSavage» Тлеулиевым |language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today we bid farewell to Adil “modeSavage” Tleuliev |date=2025-12-28|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref><ref name="+k4zmo">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/teamnovaq/1452|title=NEW AWP – k4zmo!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-12-28|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>

|content2=
