* April 19th - '''NOVAQ''' bench the remainder of their roster. <ref name="roster bench">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/teamnovaq/1738|title=После серии внутренних обсуждений мы пришли к выводу, что последняя конфигурация состава не позволяла достигать стабильных результатов и в полной мере реализовывать потенциал команды и ожидания организации|trans_title=After a series of internal discussions, we came to the conclusion that the latest composition configuration did not allow us to achieve sustainable results and fully realize the potential of the team and the expectations of the organization|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-04-19|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
* May 7th - [[def1zer]] is acquired by [[OMEGA]]. <ref name="def1zer omega">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/teamnovaq/1753|title=def1zer – игрок Team OMEGA|trans_title=def1zer – Team OMEGA player|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-05-07|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
