* June 22nd - '''NOVAQ''' sign [[keeN]] as the team's coach. <ref name="+keeN">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/teamnovaq/1816|title=Знакомое лицо, но уже в новом для себя статусе|trans_title=A familiar face, but now in a new role|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-06-22|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
* October 1st - '''NOVAQ''' bench and transfer-list [[Pump]], [[tasman]], and [[neaLaN]]. <ref name="bench trio">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/teamnovaq/2003|title=NEWS|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-10-01|author='''NOVAQ'''}}</ref>
