|content1=
*May 6th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' is formed with [[ami]] as the team's coach. <ref name="ami">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/3813-navi-esports-camp-your-chance-to-get-into-esports|title=NAVI Esports Camp: your chance to get into esports|date=2019-05-06|author=[[tasty]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*June 14th - The [[Natus Vincere Junior/History|NAVI Esports Camp]] participants are announced. <ref name="Camp">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/3996-navi-esports-camp-participants|title=NAVI Esports Camp participants|date=2019-06-14|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*September 10th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' sign [[Gospadarov]], [[B1T]], and [[kapacho]] on a permanent basis, while [[Aunkere]], [[Whitesmith]], [[fear]], and [[Topa]] are added on a trial. <ref name="2K19">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/4549-navijunior-who-made-it-into-the-roster|title=NAVI.Junior: who made it into the roster?|date=2019-09-10|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 7th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' sign [[m0NESY]] on trial. <ref name="m0NESY">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/5297-a-new-player-in-navijunior|title=m0NESY joined NAVI.Junior|date=2020-01-07|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*January 21st - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' sign [[Topa]] permanently as he completes his trial. Additionally, [[m0NESY]] is moved to a substitute role. <ref name="+Topa">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/5378-topa-in-the-main-navi-junior-roster|title=Topa — in the main NAVI Junior roster|date=2020-01-21|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*March 11th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' sign [[Aunkere]] permanently as he completes his trial. <ref name="+Aunkere">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/5687-aunkere-joins-navijuniors-main-roster|title=Aunkere joins NAVI.Junior’s main roster|date=2020-03-11|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*March 28th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' dismiss [[Whitesmith]] from the team. <ref name="-White">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/5772-whitesmith-leaves-navijunior|title=Whitesmith leaves NAVI.Junior|date=2020-03-28|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*April 7th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' sign [[headtr1ck]] as a substitute player. Additionally, [[fear]] is moved to a substitute role. <ref name="headtr1ck sub">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/5864-new-player-in-navijunior|title=New player in NAVI.Junior|date=2020-04-07|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*December 20th - [[Natus Vincere]] promote [[B1T]] to the main team. <ref name="-B1T">{{inside source}}</ref>

|content3=
*February 23rd - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' bench [[Gospadarov]], [[kapacho]], and [[Topa]]. <ref name="3bench">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/7760-cs-junior-reshuffle|title=Major changes in NAVI Junior|date=2021-02-23|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*March 11th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' move [[fear]] and [[m0NESY]] to the starting lineup. [[pogor3lov]] and [[SynyX]] are added from [[Natus Vincere Youth|NAVI Youth]]. <ref name="2K21">{{cite web|url=https://youtu.be/Lmog-n_2R6g|title=#NAVIVLOG: New NAVI Junior First Bootcamp|date=2021-03-11|author=[[BlackBunny]]|publisher='''Natus Vincere Junior'''}}</ref>
*May 3rd - [[Gospadarov]]'s contract expires and he leaves '''Natus Vincere Junior'''. <ref name="-Gospadarov">{{inside source}}</ref>
*November 4th - [[SynyX]] leaves to join [[1shot]]. <ref name="-SynyX">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/lostdfoff?w=wall-183197264_1136|title=Время идёт и нужно двигаться дальше|trans_title=Time passes and we need to move on|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2021-11-04|author=[[lostdf]]}}</ref>
*December 8th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' transfer-list [[Aunkere]], [[fear]], and [[m0NESY]]. <ref name="m0NESY bench">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/9335-the-new-cycle-of-navi-junior|title=The new cycle of NAVI Junior CS:GO|date=2021-12-08|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*December 20th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' promote [[latt1kk]], [[nipl]], [[fen2k]], and [[UNBR0KEN]] to the starting lineup from [[Natus Vincere Youth|NAVI Youth]]. <ref name="YouthDec20">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/9403-navi-junior-new-roster|title=New NAVI Junior roster|date=2021-12-20|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>

|content4=
*January 3rd - [[m0NESY]] is acquired by [[G2 Esports]]. <ref name="G2 m0NESY">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/9441-cs-m0nesy-leaves-navi|title=m0NESY transfers to G2 Esports|date=2022-01-03|author=[[RusseD]]|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*March 31st - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' part ways with [[latt1kk]] and [[fen2k]] and reinstate [[fear]] to the active lineup. <ref name="war">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/9678-cs-navi-academy-changes|title=Big changes in NAVI CS:GO academy|date=2022-03-31|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*April 16th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' promote [[Dem0N]] and [[froz1k]] to the starting lineup from [[Natus Vincere Youth|NAVI Youth]]. <ref name="+Dem0N froz1k">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/read/text/9704-cs-navi-jr-new-roster|title=The new NAVI Junior CS:GO roster|date=2022-04-16|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*June 1st - [[Aunkere]] announces his free agency and leaves the team. <ref name="-Aunkere">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Aunkere/status/1532043508344840195|title=Now I’m Free Agent|date=2022-06-01|author=[[Aunkere]]}}</ref>
*June 16th - [[ami]] is promoted to Head of Esports. <ref name="ami head of esports">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/ami-and-n1ghtend-appointed-to-new-positions|title=Ami and N1ghtEnd appointed to new positions|date=2022-06-16|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*September 2nd - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' transfer-list [[headtr1ck]]. <ref name="headtr1ck transfer list">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/headtr1ck-up-for-transfer|title=headtr1ck up for transfer|date=2022-09-02|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*September 27th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' sign [[yab0ku-]], [[rendY]] and move [[crush]] to the position of head coach from [[Natus Vincere Youth]]. <ref name="+yab0 rendY">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/navijr-new-players-and-coach|title=NAVI Junior: two new players and a coach change|date=2022-09-27|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*December 30th - [[Natus Vincere]] promote [[npl]] to the main team. <ref name="npl main">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/cs-iem-2023-roster|date=2022-12-30|title=NAVI CS:GO Roster for IEM Katowice 2023|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>

|content5=
*January 9th - [[headtr1ck]] is acquired by [[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]. <ref name="-headtr1ck">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/cs-headtr1ck-nip|title=headtr1ck transfers to Ninjas in Pyjamas|date=2023-01-09|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*March 23rd - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' part ways with [[yab0ku-]] and sign [[nikitea]]. <ref name="+nikitea">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/cs-junior-nikitea|title=NAVI Junior adds a 16-year-old new player|date=2023-03-23|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*July 26th - The Ukrainian roster of '''Natus Vincere Junior''' is moved to [[Natus Vincere Youth]] as the academy opens to international players. <ref name="JtoY">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/looking-for-a-coach-englishspeaking-navi-junior-csgo|title=Looking for a coach to work with English-speaking NAVI Junior CS:GO roster|date=2023-07-26|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*August 16th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' appoint [[Kairi]] as the academy's coach to build a new roster. <ref name="+Kairi">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/navi-introduced-navijr-coach|title=NAVI introduced the NAVI Junior coach|date=2023-08-16|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*October 15th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' promote [[dem0n]] from [[Natus Vincere Youth]] and complete their lineup with the signings of [[Magic (Ukrainian player)|Magic]], [[Krabeni]], [[makazze]] and [[fnl]]. <ref name="+CS2">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/csjunior-new-roster-october-23|title=Meet the new NAVI Junior CS2 roster|date=2023-10-15|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>

|content6=
* February 23rd - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' part ways with [[fnl]]. <ref name="-fnl">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/fnl_csgo/status/1761070069944107065|title=Me and @navijunior decided to part ways and am now a free agent|date=2024-02-23|author=[[fnl]]}}</ref>
* May 6th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' part ways with [[Kairi]]. <ref name="-kairi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Kairi_pirriki/status/1787526344647004247|title=From today I’m no longer part of @navijunior|date=2024-05-06|author=[[Kairi]]}}</ref>
* May 20th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' part ways with [[Magic (Ukrainian player)|Magic]], move [[makazze]] to a substitute role, and promote [[froz1k]], [[cmtry]], [[dziugss]], and [[coolio]] from [[Natus Vincere Youth]]. <ref name="2024 changes">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/csjun-navi-academy-restructuring|title=NAVI Academy restructuring: new Junior СS2 roster|date=2024-05-20|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>

|content7=
*July 8th - [[makazze]] is promoted to the [[Natus Vincere|main team]]. <ref name="-makazze">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/jl-takes-a-career-break|title=jL takes a career break|date=2025-07-08|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*August 1st - [[dem0n]], [[Krabeni]], [[cmtry]], [[dziugss]], and [[coolio]] are acquired by [[FUT Esports]]. <ref name="-navi jr 2025">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/navi-junior-join-fut-esports|title=NAVI Junior join FUT Esports|date=2025-08-01|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*October 1st - [[kodak]], [[Yoki]], and [[snatchie]] are promoted from [[Natus Vincere Youth]], the latter as coach. <ref name="+new navi jr 2025">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/cs2jun-2-players-visa-academy|title=First two NAVI Junior CS2 players revealed!|date=2025-10-01|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*November 10th - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' sign [[satsu]], [[R3ZLOO]], and acquire [[FAZERY]] from [[Dark Tigers]]. <ref name="+satsu +R3ZLOO +FAZERY">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/navi-junior-2025|title=New NAVI Junior СS2 roster|date=2025-11-10|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>

|content8=
*March 31st - '''Natus Vincere Junior''' part ways with [[satsu]] and [[R3ZLOO]] and sign [[MahaR]] and [[skizzyee]] as their replacements. <ref name="mar 2026 duo">{{cite web|url=https://navi.gg/en/publications/csjun-march-26-changes|title=Changes to the NAVI Junior CS2 roster|date=2026-03-31|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
}}

